 of both the classes (0 and 1). Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn Logistic Regression gave AUC=0.95, but the precision was very low (0.08). So, I tried Random Forests and it gave AUC=0.94 and precision=0.85 (with 'gini' criterion) and AUC=0.92 & precision=0.83 (with 'entropy' criterion). Measured performance metrics-accuracy, precision, recall, AUC and plotted ROC curve Used the following modules in Python-Pandas, NumPy, Scikit-Learn, matplotlib, Imbalanced-learn","topics":[],"score":235333,"global_rank":93555,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16179},{"name":"cs15b047/Blockchain-Projects","owner":"cs15b047","html_url":"https://github.com/cs15b047/Blockchain-Projects","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":235328,"global_rank":93557,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16180},{"name":"gregk/redis_tui","owner":"gregk","html_url":"https://github.com/gregk/redis_tui","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This is a Terminal UI (TUI) for redis to showcase the power of the textual library","topics":[],"score":235322,"global_rank":93569,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16181},{"name":"mycoleb/SiobhanSavesAmerica","owner":"mycoleb","html_url":"https://github.com/mycoleb/SiobhanSavesAmerica","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":235322,"global_rank":93570,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16182},{"name":"juh2600/gcode-tools","owner":"juh2600","html_url":"https://github.com/juh2600/gcode-tools","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":235322,"global_rank":93572,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":16183},{"name":"RandolphTang/CSE-415","owner":"RandolphTang","html_url":"https://github.com/RandolphTang/CSE-415","stars":0,"forks":0,"